  <ImageTitle>
    ホワファンのスプライト
  </ImageTitle>
  <Author>
    Niji System (Satoki Nijikawa, Wamo, Kiyoi, Vihreääketty, Hsiao Lyuhsien, Antiainehunt Õudus, Rinith, Q'aemil)
  </Author>
  <Date>
    2025/07/11
  </Date>
  <ImageType>
    Portable Network Graphics (PNG) file
  </ImageType>
  <AltText>
    Sprite of li-spade's OC, Huafang. She is a dragon with golden brown skin/scales, dark green hair, and green eyes. Her horns are a gradient from dark green to green-yellow. Her tail has golden scales running down the spine of it, with a light cream-coloured underbelly. The tail is tipped with a green-yellow flame. Her dress is a classic red Chinese dress with faded tannish yellow details.
  </AltText>
  <Description>
    Made a sprite for Huafang.
    She was quite fun to sprite, even if I couldn't get all of her details &gt;.&lt;
    Did do a gradient on her horns (actual gradient, no dithering), so that was fun :3
    The dress turned out quite good, I think. Very fitting for a dragon!
  </Description>
  <Dimensions>
